{"type":"new","contents":"namespace GW.PrimaMateria\n\nuniverse uC uP uX uβ ucoh ucyc ucoeff\nuniverse uM uO uQH uNov uB uASer uBSer uOther uDict\n\n/-- Ambient data only. No theorem says such a context is mathematically adequate. -/\nstructure StableMapContext where\n  Target : Type uX\n  Curve : Type uC\n  Point : Curve → Type uP\n  CurveClass : Type uβ\n  CohClass : Type ucoh\n  CycleClass : Type ucyc\n  Coeff : Type ucoeff\n  genusOf : Curve → Nat\n  IsStableMap :\n    {C : Curve} → {n : Nat} →\n      (Fin n → Point C) → (Point C → Target) → CurveClass → Prop\n\n/-- A concrete stable-map witness, relative to the predicates supplied by the context. -/\nstructure StableMapWitness\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext) (g n : Nat) (β : Ctx.CurveClass) where\n  source : Ctx.Curve\n  markings : Fin n → Ctx.Point source\n  toTarget : Ctx.Point source → Ctx.Target\n  genus_ok : Ctx.genusOf source = g\n  stable_ok : Ctx.IsStableMap markings toTarget β\n\n/-- Candidate moduli object. `representsStatement` is not proved here. -/\nstructure StableMapModuliWitness\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext) (g n : Nat) (β : Ctx.CurveClass) where\n  Moduli : Type uM\n  pointAsStableMap : Moduli → StableMapWitness Ctx g n β\n  representsStatement : Prop\n\n/-- Candidate virtual fundamental class packet. No VFC existence theorem is asserted. -/\nstructure VirtualFundamentalClassWitness\n    {Ctx : StableMapContext} {g n : Nat} {β : Ctx.CurveClass}\n    (M : StableMapModuliWitness Ctx g n β) where\n  ObstructionTheory : Type uO\n  virtualClass : Ctx.CycleClass\n  virtualDimension : Int\n  constructionStatement : Prop\n  functorialityStatement : Prop\n\n/-- Insertions for primary and descendant GW invariants. -/\nstructure GWInsertion (Ctx : StableMapContext) (n : Nat) where\n  cohomology : Fin n → Ctx.CohClass\n  psiPower : Fin n → Nat\n\n/-- Candidate GW invariant value. The defining equality is only a statement field. -/\nstructure GWInvariantWitness\n    {Ctx : StableMapContext} {g n : Nat} {β : Ctx.CurveClass}\n    (M : StableMapModuliWitness Ctx g n β)\n    (V : VirtualFundamentalClassWitness M) where\n  insertions : GWInsertion Ctx n\n  value : Ctx.Coeff\n  definitionStatement : Prop\n  dimensionMatchStatement : Prop\n\n/-- Candidate quantum product. Associativity/unit are not asserted. -/\nstructure QuantumProductWitness (Ctx : StableMapContext) where\n  QH : Type uQH\n  Novikov : Type uNov\n  unit : QH\n  qprod : QH → QH → QH\n  classicalLimit : QH → Ctx.CohClass\n  coefficientGWStatement : Prop\n  associativityStatement : Prop\n  unitStatement : Prop\n\n/-- Candidate A/B-side mirror comparison packet. -/\nstructure MirrorComparisonPacket (A : StableMapContext) where\n  BModel : Type uB\n  ASeries : Type uASer\n  BSeries : Type uBSer\n  mirrorMap : ASeries → BSeries\n  targetHypothesesStatement : Prop\n  comparisonStatement : Prop\n  normalizationStatement : Prop\n\ninductive CorrespondenceKind where\n  | gwDT\n  | gwHurwitz\n\n/-- Candidate correspondence packet: GW/DT, GW/Hurwitz, etc. -/\nstructure CorrespondenceCandidate (kind : CorrespondenceKind) where\n  GWTheory : Type uQH\n  OtherTheory : Type uOther\n  dictionary : Type uDict\n  changeOfVariablesStatement : Prop\n  comparisonStatement : Prop\n  provenScopeStatement : Prop\n\nabbrev DTCorrespondenceCandidate :=\n  CorrespondenceCandidate CorrespondenceKind.gwDT\n\nabbrev HurwitzCorrespondenceCandidate :=\n  CorrespondenceCandidate CorrespondenceKind.gwHurwitz\n\n/-- Generic promotion wrapper: constructing this is mathematical content. -/\nstructure CertifiedStatement (P : Prop) where\n  proof : P\n\nend GW.PrimaMateria\n","mtime":1778095194935}